1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,645
I can’t tell my family what I want.

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:08,420
Think privately. Correct it. Choose whether to explore peers.

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,800
Fictional Arjun. No model connected.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,870
For adults facing family pressure.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,870
Planned Muse Spark can organize themes.

6
