He wants time to decide what he wants.

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,660
Now the editable reflection changes with his words.

12
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:45,155
This is still an editable reflection.

13
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:50,050
Arjun chooses to keep the takeaway privately.

14
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,300
Peer stories are optional, not a required next step.

15
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:59,295
Day four: one peer names pressure from family calls.

16
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:04,275
Day nine: the host can listen, not decide for him.

17
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:08,200
A prepared example holds a directive reply.

18
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:12,085
Day sixteen: Dev's question has no replies yet.

19
