Ravi accepts questions in the group only.

20
00:01:17,770 --> 00:01:21,730
The alias, audience and edited question stay visible.

21
00:01:22,430 --> 00:01:26,795
Private context is excluded. Consent stays unchecked.

22
00:01:27,130 --> 00:01:29,485
This preview sends nothing.

23
00:01:31,130 --> 00:01:34,075
His private takeaway stays selected.

24
00:01:35,630 --> 00:01:38,565
I can ask for time before deciding.

25
00:01:40,130 --> 00:01:43,280
